msgid "Introduction to luit"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/x/installing/luit.xml:28
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <application>luit</application> package is a filter that can be run "
"between an arbitrary application and a UTF-8 terminal emulator. It will "
"convert application output from the locale’s encoding into UTF‐8, and "
"convert terminal input from UTF‐8 into the locale’s encoding."
